    "reason": "The assertion that neurons generate and transmit electrical messages as their primary mode of signaling is well-established in neurobiology. Action potentials (electrical signals) propagate along axons to synapses, where they trigger chemical transmission; this hybrid process defines neuronal function. No substantive flaw exists.",
