    "reason": "The assertion that neurons transmit signals to glands via junctions (neuroglandular junctions) involving neurotransmitter release is factually sound. Neuroglandular synapses are a recognized physiological mechanism where motor or autonomic neurons directly innervate glandular cells, releasing neurotransmitters to regulate secretion.",
